-- title:
--   Gcd profile bounds a finite-frame progression mean
-- statement:
--   For B≥2, positive Q and G, a GcdProfile(Q,G,h), and a finite set F of positive integers, the progression mean over 2^j samples of the sum of kernel weights is bounded by the sum of profile weights, profileErrorSum, an explicit G,Q,j term divided by B^G−1, and 4·2^(−j).
